    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51043ca8226146ba422915df",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真正特别的人，\n就是会从这种地方重新爬起来啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "061db690ea3c5f5fc541c743d44575fe11b55aa830f972d645501e0e542617fd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4da21c3a406e54ca8b73ca3b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想与伏特加。\n看着她们在激战后互相称赞对方英姿的模样，\n会场内的气氛变得比之前更加热烈沸腾了――",
      "source_fingerprint": "e885c724f46a5a1ed6837e078b045dd823a55f72184a1278a065a632a2653c6a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85d71f69343bef5252f45092",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――就这样。在『日本杯』上，\n红色梦想与跨越世代的那些老练强者们\n展开了一场热血沸腾的激战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec925f5b610e585b7b5f9fabc8feeb40d4c80d8d411363c4ea2356610bcd9156",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db3dbebaf4256b763883e576",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如今世人对她的瞩目程度，\n已经达到了无法估量的地步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00042c763508dcf804fd3054e6b4d4701c67f0f2a0a2dc66f977d1d0c4a3f71a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f83c955e1b4156fe8ac8531",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63fd61b969283576fb7c6a61",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "请向我，赐予更进一步的挑战――",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0aeec0495c1597ed5dd54d367745944a4c0daf5c0e78118ac964229fd19eba3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6dbe6c481433335e57605d1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "等、等等等等等一下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8de3151433975cf512bc05f307c85da0c783f7883f8dbe4844febcb754fb1513",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7ce169ddba57f13b493b6bc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
