    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64af0e5b6f8b40df4217abd9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……唔，\n明明我的玛那正处于前所未有的高涨状态……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1bdefe2afc66166bf542ea2ea7f0b52e671aa0dde8bc6fb87ede33d4bf8a4bc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fd2dfaf05026147465a3500",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "全力跑完了经典级、\n并斩获了辉煌功绩的红色梦想。\n此时她已经迫不及待地开始寻求下一个试炼了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2284b12d6814634952ac7fad8a1a137285a2d10bd32b8dda911af04f1c3c472",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a752256d4a2009cf3bc83b1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在即将到来的古马级中，\n真想为她准备一个配得上她的舞台。\n必须得好好地制定一下计划了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b8a38a33b38e172ec1f9765fa8c042c88a6c431da40fc8e07b9f222d4fc215c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15e9fbff0d1d6964eaffb819",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "伏特加",
