      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是渡过重洋，\n去向那片广袤的世界发起挑战吗……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "31a20131917720717d8da28a974cf6d40911f24846df79fe34cf796cc3964053",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
