    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:050e683a2d992d34a6a0746f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『干得漂亮』『太精彩了』――……落下的，\n是如雷动般的欢呼与赞赏。\n它们源源不断地洒落到红色梦想的头顶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c882254cd53581dc77596f414f32fb76f05b94d3931a372f1d4ee1110ef59d66",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
