    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1baf61e4b5fd0418acdfd5bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果能制霸那里的比赛，\n说不定就能够抵达『异世界』了――",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3232b049215aaf7634c6bfbeb79ba13c846bd6b5bf12d5a55dfb96c2af12ba0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        50,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89496521324603ca83fcc517",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“也许『异世界』的真相，\n就是向海外的赛事发起挑战吧”",
      "source_fingerprint": "340977c4b745ec0bd98eb0d7171a442774765e965da5333b13d0ad503909441d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136315.json",
      "json_path": [
