      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "继达成了三冠伟业之后，如今竟然终于\n制霸了『育马者杯』！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1256bdf87cbb24b80fdd7ea1a1ea5037c846fd2d1b49ec5d1478fbfb2c5da40d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
