    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d04132209263768d3b2e6bc3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "幼时曾梦见过的那份憧憬，\n如果如今能与红色梦想一同将其化作现实的话，\n那将会是一件多么美妙的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "046d545d3d22b3f75127026ad3b57f4805cb9e9c784f811ace354e14e01276e2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
